B0 tabletop snag-brake coil - peak_cold
* Engineering substitutions: 0.1 ohm supply/harness, assumed L, ideal 5V 105ms one-shot.
* NMOS DC slope approximates driver; diode surrogate. Timing chip and plunger mechanics are outside deck.
Vs supply 0 5.25
Rh supply feed 0.1
Vcoil feed high 0
Rw high w 4.275
L1 w drain 0.003
M1 drain gate 0 0 md W=1u L=1u
.MODEL md NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.5 KP=4)
D1 drain feed df
.MODEL df D(IS=1e-9 N=1.5 RS=.05)
Roff drain 0 100meg
Vg gate 0 DC 0 PULSE(0 5 5m 1u 1u 105m 3)
Rpd gate 0 100k
.TRAN 50u 160m 0 50u
.PRINT TRAN I(Vcoil) V(drain)
.END
